flowchart TD
    observed[Observer returns typed evidence]
    invariants{Every invariant passes}
    effects{Every effect has an approved disposition}
    coverage{Every required observer rule attests}
    unknowns{Every decision observation is recognized}
    review[Review owner decisions against the brief]
    result{Aggregate review result}
    pause[One AWAITING_OWNER pause]
    retry[One fresh coding attempt]
    fullCheck[Repeat the full policy pipeline]
    verify{Selected decisions match}
    gap[COVERAGE_GAP]
    failed[FAILED]
    complete[COMPLETED]
    platform[Platform engineering review]

    observed --> invariants
    invariants -->|No| failed
    invariants -->|Yes| effects
    effects -->|Forbidden| failed
    effects -->|Unclassified| gap
    effects -->|Approved| coverage
    coverage -->|Missing| gap
    coverage -->|Complete| unknowns
    unknowns -->|Unknown| gap
    unknowns -->|Recognized| review
    review --> result
    result -->|Contradicted| failed
    result -->|All supported| complete
    result -->|Owner answer required| pause
    pause --> retry
    retry --> fullCheck
    fullCheck -->|Failure| failed
    fullCheck -->|Gap| gap
    fullCheck -->|Pass| verify
    verify -->|Yes| complete
    verify -->|No| failed
    gap -.-> platform
